OL,3,AThird runway at Heathrow Airport would
OL,4,Adrive growth, Healey says
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has said
OL,7,Fbuilding a third runway at Heathrow
OL,8,FAirport has "always been a case for
OL,9,Fgrowth" after Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham refused to say if he backed the
OL,11,Fexpansion.
OL,13,FHealey said airport expansion,
OL,14,Fincluding at Heathrow, had been "a big
OL,15,Fpart of jobs and growth" in recent
OL,16,Fdecades, speaking at the International
OL,17,FMonetary Fund (IMF) in Bangkok.
OL,19,FHis comments came after Prime Minister
OL,20,FAndy Burnham was more sceptical,
OL,21,Ftelling the BBC last month it was "a
OL,22,Fmatter for London and Londoners".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
